# Placeholder secrets for the sample fixture's stage env.
# REAL projects MUST gitignore <env>.env files — these committed
# values exist only so docex's release/migrate code paths have an
# env file to read when exercising this fixture under tests.
#
# Engine-managed env vars are NOT declared here: POSTGRES_PASSWORD is
# `kind: minted` (docex mints it into the host TTE store at release) and
# POSTGRES_USER is `kind: fixed` (inlined at compile). Listing either
# here would collide with the TTE store during release aggregation.
